Ruang
=====

Ruang is a modified fork of BrightBean Studio:
https://github.com/brightbeanxyz/brightbean-studio

The software and modifications are distributed under the GNU Affero General
Public License, version 3.0. See LICENSE for the complete license text.

Material modifications include the Ruang name and visual identity, AI content
automation, Brand Brain, campaign/content planning, human approval, publishing
and retry workflows, analytics feedback, provider abstraction, X integration,
and the legal/privacy/deployment baseline.

Operators providing a modified version over a network must keep a prominent
link to the Corresponding Source for the exact deployed revision. Ruang exposes
that offer through /legal/open-source/ and the application footer when
RUANG_SOURCE_CODE_URL and RUANG_SOURCE_CODE_REVISION are configured.

